  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Routine verbs",
   "texto": [
    "Learn these verbs with their meaning: **просыпаться** (wake up), **умываться** (wash your face) and **одеваться** (dress). In **встречаться**, the action is mutual: **мы встречаемся** means «See you.» or «We're staying.»."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Comparison and genitive",
   "texto": [
    "**Быстрее меня** means «Faster than me»: after the comparative, **меня** is the **я** genius. You can also say **быстрее, чем я**. In **после школы**, **школы** is genitive after **после**."
   ]
